    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e71d0b27508240d5a9b8c9a76b723bfb",
      "statement": "Because the LangSmith proxy-config API rejects updates on a sandbox that is not ready, _configure_github_proxy responds to a not-ready status by best-effort starting the (stopped, not deleted) sandbox and retrying the PATCH, and retries transient failures with backoff.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://agent/integrations/langsmith.py#L391-L453",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f7a3c7ce19c8c2884bc96c1b312c28b2dab7cf604f29f409a06d38c831121665:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_8635ffdb6f2a40e4bd581a66175b6c13",
      "statement": "GitHub App installation tokens expire after about an hour, so agent/utils/github_proxy.py records each thread's token expiry and scope and maybe_refresh_proxy_token re-mints and re-applies the token when within PROXY_TOKEN_REFRESH_WINDOW (5 minutes) of expiry or after PROXY_TOKEN_FALLBACK_TTL (50 minutes) when expiry is unknown, preserving the original repository and permission scope so rotation never broadens the token.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://agent/utils/github_proxy.py#L1-L37",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:0d77ea096b08dea6c6878e351b6b1d211d1a264cb6d0e883f6537c7a77ea507e:"
        },
        {
