      "id": "claim_ac87deb90bcd47d4a71673b324e97fcf",
      "statement": "The GitHub proxy applies only to the langsmith provider: _refresh_github_proxy and refresh_proxy_token return early when SANDBOX_TYPE is not langsmith.",
