    {
      "id": "claim_0360f8d8a7e446aa92850cd110db81d7",
      "statement": "The local provider runs a LocalShellBackend directly on the host with no isolation, scoping git config --global to a sandbox-local .gitconfig-sandbox (that includes the developer's real ~/.gitconfig) so the per-run bot identity does not clobber the host identity, and excluding model/provider API keys from the inherited environment.",
