      "statement": "New sandboxes boot from the environment's ready snapshot when one exists, otherwise the admin-configured base snapshot (falling back to DEFAULT_SANDBOX_SNAPSHOT_ID), resolved by _resolve_sandbox_create_config alongside VM sizing and create parameters.",
